# Enrichment: the Provider (endpoint, model and key) is chosen in the web UI,
# under Settings, and stored in the library. Nothing here configures it.

# --- Authentication (WebAuthn / passkeys) ---
# Behind a reverse proxy (Cloudflare tunnel) these MUST match what the BROWSER
# sees, not the local server. RP_ID is the bare domain; RP_ORIGIN includes the
# scheme. Cookie Secure flag is enabled automatically for https origins.
#
# Production example:
#   RP_ID=docs.example.com
#   RP_ORIGIN=https://docs.example.com
#   RP_NAME=zayla
#
# Local dev defaults (used when unset): RP_ID=localhost,
# RP_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000, RP_NAME=zayla
